This is the new version of the project.

Done by Pranav Khatri on Oct 24 - Oct 27

Features/Bug Fixes:
- All templates with the same number of nodes are the same size 
regardless of the magnifier/how zoomed the screen is.
- Allows to spam add the templates instead of having the click 
on the dropdown everytime to add a template onto the sandbox.

Future updates:
- Plan on creating a feature to give the user the option to move around an entire template/network instead of just nodes.
- Need to fix it so the distance between the templates remain the same 
when zoomed in.
- Would like to implement major changes on the design to make it more
eye appealing and easier to use
- Waiting for Tommorow (Oct 28) to meet up with the client before working 
anymore on this today

How to use?

Please simply just replace the Sandbox.jsx file in sigma-prototype folder
with this one. All of the other instructions remain the same.
